["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 127: Bashshar ibn Burd Shu&#x27;ubiyya badee apophasis al-adab qasida\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-15-litandhist-他用征服者的语言写诗-最后被缝进袋子扔进河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/43e959018e740613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文學與歷史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>他用征服者的語言寫詩，最後被縫進袋子扔進河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Bashshar ibn Burd 是釋奴之孫、盲人詩人，用阿拉伯語諷刺阿拉伯人，罵哈里發還活了二十年——直到一句詩把他送進底格里斯河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿拉伯詩歌</span><span class=\"tag\">阿拔斯王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"‘Holy grail’ of naked mole-rat research reveals how queens rule isopropyl myristate naked mole-rat super-puff intuitive gamer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-15-naturepod-裸鼹鼠女王不靠尿液-靠一种5美元分子维持王位/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>裸鼴鼠女王靠5美元分子統治：不是尿液，是護膚成分</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">裸鼴鼠的生殖抑制信號終於被找到：女王獨產 isopropyl myristate。把它加進失去女王的群體就和平，停掉就爆發王位戰；同一種分子還出現在哺乳期女性身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">裸鼴鼠</span><span class=\"tag\">化學信號</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"羅永浩的X字路口！一年一度裝x大會 old money 尖團音\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-15-cn2d7912-装逼能不能成-拿捏的是文化隔阂的远近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/570a4c2dc21c8b72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:57:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>裝逼能不能成，拿捏的是文化隔閡的遠近</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">裝逼的本質是用最少信息快速立住人設：隔閡太近等於沒裝，隔閡太遠對方看不懂，也等於白裝。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">裝逼文化</span><span class=\"tag\">階層鄙視鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"172: Momenta IPO後再訪曹旭東：就是想做沒有盡頭的AI world model RoboVan RoboTruck post-train data scaling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-15-latetalk-智驾好和更好的行业-只容得下两三家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8cd6cf382873d1be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:03:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>智駕供應商終局只剩兩三家，窗口年底關閉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Momenta 曹旭東判斷，智駕像電池一樣只有好和更好，三方供應商終局中國兩三家、全球三四家；第一梯隊市佔率已90%，數據飛輪和量產是入場券，下一站是物理AI和家庭機器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CPU這個老登，竟然在智能體時代重新翻身了？ KV Cache RAS AMX PD分離 RDMA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-14-laoshi-智能体时代gpu常年堵车-cpu才是那套红绿灯系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5956a359adfacff7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">22:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0714</span></div>\n<h2>智能體時代GPU常年堵車，CPU才是那套紅綠燈系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體把AI工作方式從並行概率預測變成串行任務執行，GPU因為缺乏分支預測和亂序執行能力而頻繁空轉，CPU的邏輯調度能力因此成了數據中心新的稀缺資源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Simplex Algorithm, Mathematical Details!!! simplex algorithm feasible region objective function slack variable Gaussian elimination ratio test\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-13-statquest-线性规划最优解不在内部-单纯形法只沿边界顶点爬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa1aa79aeced790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">27:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">StatQuest</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0713</span></div>\n<h2>線性規劃最優解不在內部：單純形法只沿邊界頂點爬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">線性規劃的最優解總在某個邊界頂點上，所以單純形法不搜索區域內部：從原點出發，用最大負數列選方向、最小比率定步長，不斷換到收益更高的相鄰頂點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線性規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">單純形法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Brown – A deep but accessible introduction to general relativity equivalence principle fictitious / inertial force Schwarzschild radius / event horizon gravitational time dilation spaghettification\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-10-dwarkesh-黑洞是效率-100-的发电厂-聚变只到百分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9cb4dda1cfbcd52e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞是效率 100% 的發電廠，聚變只到百分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把磚慢慢吊到視界正上方再鬆手，靜質能可以 100% 變成遠處的功；化學燃燒只有百億分之一、聚變只有百分之一，因為核反應根本碰不到質子中子的靜質量，只有引力能碰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">廣義相對論</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"羅永浩的X字路口！如果可以，你會刪除伴侶出軌的記憶嗎？\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-10-cn2d7912-ai伴侣再完美也打动不了人-排斥非同类刻在基因里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0367758a99f46207-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:12:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侶再完美也打動不了人：排斥非同類刻在基因裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">節目裡最被認可的一個解釋是：拒絕完美AI伴侶不是因為它不夠好，而是人類基因裡對非同類的本能排斥，再完美也繞不過去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">愛情觀</span><span class=\"tag\">AI伴侶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E243｜特朗普“緩刑”紅牌之外，美國資本如何硬控全球足壇 Leveraged Buyout Asset Securitization Evergreen Fund Super League Matchday Revenue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-10-sv101-美国资本硬控足坛-不只买队-还在收租/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>美資控盤英超11隊，靠的不是足球是金融</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美資已控盤英超11支球隊，還把手伸進歐足聯商業開發、版權分銷和球員轉會金融；版權費見頂後，它們靠推高估值和永續基金繼續玩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育投資</span><span class=\"tag\">英超</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"269. 卷規模 VS 卷創作：真人短劇的兩種生存模式 RY DIT 斬殺線 金手指\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-09-luanfanshu-月产-300-部短剧不靠灵感-靠本金安全与人物关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b655f3a7a4cc727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0709</span></div>\n<h2>短劇兩種活法：規模流保本金，內容流靠人物關係</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">短劇有兩種活法：規模流靠本金安全與月產 300 部的確定性收益，內容流靠人物關係決定動機；兩邊都認為 AI 暫時取代不了真人的微表情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真人短劇</span><span class=\"tag\">產能管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ageing and Society pension credit means-tested benefits triple lock co-production Beveridge\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-07-thinkingallowed-英国两百万老人悄悄贫困-宁可对家人撒谎也不求助/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7854ea338f392d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Thinking Allowed</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0707</span></div>\n<h2>英國兩百萬老人悄悄貧困：寧可對家人撒謊也不求助</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">能拿到的養老金補貼，只有63%的老人真正去申請——擋住他們的不是沒錢可領，而是不想讓家人知道自己過得差，也怕把現有的一點都搭進去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養老金</span><span class=\"tag\">老年貧困</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E242｜最快半年AI跑通自進化？與陳天橋首席科學家聊聊硅谷模型必爭之地 RSI Recursive Drift Heavy Duty Solver Discovery Model Agent Team\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-06-sv101-ai最快半年跑通自进化-验证与品味是最后门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0706</span></div>\n<h2>AI自我進化最快半年跑通，但模型會悄悄跑偏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 的拐點是模型能勝任長程任務。Apodex 首席科學家稱最快半年跑通自我進化閉環，但遞歸漂移與模型品味仍需人類長期把關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI自進化</span><span class=\"tag\">RSI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 263: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 13 &quot;The Four Strands&quot; Part 4 - and final. universal explainer explanatory gap copper atom argument Conway&#x27;s Game of Life\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-04-tokcast-ai-至今没造出一个新理论-所以它不是人工人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0704</span></div>\n<h2>AI 至今沒造出一個新理論，所以它不是人工人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Deutsch 的判據是：AI 只是把已知理論裡沒算完的部分填上，屬於給有機化學圖景塗色。要夠到創造新知識的門檻，得先有問題——而 LLM 沒有問題，問題是我們給它的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">認識論</span><span class=\"tag\">多世界解釋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Narcissists: Are We Surrounded? NPI NPD Grandiose narcissism Gray rocking Empathy prompt Triple E\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-02-sciencevs-没有自恋流行病-自恋者只是更痛苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">44:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0702</span></div>\n<h2>自戀流行病是媒體炒作：數據不支持，患者其實更痛苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">媒體熱炒的「自戀流行病」缺少數據支持；NPI 測得的自戀水平近年反而在下降。真正的 NPD 約 1%，患者常伴抑鬱焦慮，治療有效但需數年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自戀</span><span class=\"tag\">NPD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Grant Sanderson – AI and the future of math grindability theory of mind RLVR Langlands Program\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-30-dwarkesh-数学家未来是策展人-价值不在证明里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b8f892d1d8c883d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0630</span></div>\n<h2>數學家未來是策展人，價值不在證明裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 能解題、能解釋、能證明定理；數學家的價值將轉向判斷哪條路值得走——併成為人們信任的策展人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 能力邊界</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Charity Shops and Pocket Money quiet economy entitlements, payments and enterprise Mitumba\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-30-thinkingallowed-捐给慈善商店的衣物-七到九成从未在店里卖出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7854ea338f392d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Thinking Allowed</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0630</span></div>\n<h2>捐給慈善商店的衣物，七到九成從未在店裡賣出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">慈善商店捐贈的衣物裡，真正被賣給顧客的只佔一到三成，其餘大多出口到肯尼亞等地的二手市場，當地處理不了的部分最終被填埋或焚燒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零花錢</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善商店</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The next big breakthrough will be AIs learning on the job RLVR OPSD Dreaming KV cache Sample efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-26-dwarkesh-ai-的下一个突破-在工作中学习-而非仅靠训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd74222aed85378e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">19:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0626</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下一個突破不是訓練，是讓 AI 在工作中學習</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">實驗室押注 RLVR 能泛化出通用智能，但真正的瓶頸是樣本效率與持續學習。OPSD 與「做夢」或成關鍵，讓 AI 從部署中學習，而非只靠預訓練。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span><span class=\"tag\">RLVR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"羅永浩的X字路口！不借錢給朋友，就會失去朋友失去錢！ Hirox\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-26-cn2d7912-罗永浩没跑路-是因为没提前把钱转出国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b223004bec41efc0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:40:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0626</span></div>\n<h2>羅永浩沒跑路，是因為沒提前把錢轉出國</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正跑路的企業家都是提前轉移了財產的——羅永浩說自己沒幹這步棋，所以除了留下來一分一分把六七個億還掉，別無選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業債務</span><span class=\"tag\">借錢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"82. 中國好美護，為何還沒在歐洲火起來？ D2C JBP CPNP B Corp\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-25-cn677483-中国美妆出海欧洲-最烧钱的不是广告-是展会和经销商选错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360b57baaeb24d98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"出\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">出海進行時</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0625</span></div>\n<h2>中國美妝出海歐洲，最燒錢的不是廣告，是展會和經銷商選錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">參展費動輒幾十萬卻籤不到幾個客戶，經銷商合作是歐洲品牌十年二十年起步的長期關係，選錯一次代價可能是一整年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美妝出海</span><span class=\"tag\">歐洲市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"一期視頻看懂物理AI：大模型這麼強，為啥一到現實就翻車？ DSP PRU PQC CRA NPU Shift Left / 數字孿生\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-25-laoshi-物理世界没有撤销键-所以大模型指挥不动机械臂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/54fd853e8b527ba1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0625</span></div>\n<h2>物理世界沒有撤銷鍵，所以大模型指揮不動機械臂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">聊天答錯了可以重來，但汽車晚剎車一秒、機械臂走錯一步就沒有救場餘地——真正扛起物理世界的，是藏在設備裡幾十年的嵌入式芯片，不是大模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">嵌入式芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP4 王強：AI 狂飆時代，一個古典的人 FOMO brain rot interdependence mindfulness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-23-xiaotianzhang-真格联合创始人王强-新出的书-他一本都不读/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdfe352669029443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>真格聯合創始人王強：新出的書，他一本都不讀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的理由是：一本書今天被一億人同時追捧，下個月可能只剩一千萬人記得——暢銷本身就是會被時間淘汰的證據，所以他把閱讀時間全部留給經過幾十年檢驗的舊書。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">閱讀方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI創業邏輯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Walt Disney Company Flywheel Multiplane camera Cel animation Pencil test Seven Powers\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-22-acquired-迪士尼飞轮-艺术-商业与工程的百年复利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372eb871b3602a8b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:31:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>迪士尼護城河不是IP，是Walt的飛輪設計</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼的護城河不是IP本身，而是Walt將藝術與商業在腦中結合後，用工程手段打造的飛輪：高質量動畫、最大化發行、注入輔助節點，再以數十年複利滾動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IP運營</span><span class=\"tag\">飛輪效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 10: Burnout vs Depression: The Mental Load of Mothers Burnout DSM Medicalization Benzodiazepines\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-15-parentmojo-妈妈不是病了-是社会病了-抑郁诊断如何转移问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">18:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0615</span></div>\n<h2>媽媽不是病了，是社會病了：抑鬱診斷如何轉移問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Burnout 被誤診為抑鬱，問題被歸因於個體大腦而非社會環境。新西蘭研究發現，每天有人幫做家務六個月的產婦幾乎不產後抑鬱，但藥物仍是首選方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抑鬱診斷</span><span class=\"tag\">母親 burnout</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"145. 口述SpaceX開發史：和前高管洪力德聊，馬斯克用人觀、最大IPO、太空與AI、人類文明擴張前奏？ reusable rocket SKU first principles Class Plus Elon Mafia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-12-zhangxiaojun-spacex-前高管-火箭不是目的-马斯克要的是整个太空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/055133beb1772443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>SpaceX 前高管：火箭不是目的，馬斯克要的是整個太空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SpaceX 從不把自己當火箭公司，火箭只是手段。飛鷹一號成功後立刻退役，飛鷹九號把每公斤發射成本從兩萬美元壓到三千美元，星艦目標一百美元以下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業航天</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>"]